Remark 86.1 Let \(f: Y = \Bl_V X  irationaliso X\) be the blowup of \(X\) along a subvariety \(V\). Then one has the adjunction formula
\[
K_Y = f^* K_X + (\codim_V(X) - 1)E
    .
\]
Note that if \(X\) is a surface and \(V\) is a point, this recovers \[K_Y = f^* K_X + E.\]


Remark 86.2 Let \(f: Y	o X\) be a branched cover with branch locus \(B\) and ramification locus \(R\). Then
\[
K_Y = f^* K_X + R, \qquad R \definedas \Sum_{p\in X} \mathrm{len}\qty{ \Omega_{X/Y, p}} [p].
\]

